  <NAME>OCI-AML1-Cas9 EKO chemogenomic CRISPR screen</NAME>
  <TITLE>OCI-AML1-Cas9 EKO chemogenomic CRISPR screen</TITLE>
  <DESCRIPTION>Identify genes that show synthetic lethal and synthetic recue interactions with chemical compounds Overall design: OCI-AML1-Cas9 EKO library cells were treated with compounds UM171 and DMSO as control for 14 days. Cells were pelleted every 2 days and DNA was extracted. ID sequences of the sgRNAs were amplified by PCR and the products were sent for sequencing in Illumina Nextseq500</DESCRIPTION>
